OL,3,GNEWSAFriends embark on 20-year board
OL,4,Agame battle
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo friends from Newcastle have set
OL,7,Fthemselves the challenge of completing
OL,8,Fa board game which has never officially
OL,9,Fbeen completed. They expect it will
OL,10,Ftake 20 years as they battle to fit it
OL,11,Faround their everyday lives - but while
OL,12,Fgames can often put friendships to the
OL,13,Ftest, the pair are determined to see it
OL,14,Fthrough, no matter how different life
OL,15,Fwill look.
OL,17,FWhat would you be willing to commit
OL,18,F1,500 hours of your life doing?
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
