OL,3,GNEWSAFriends embark on 20-year board
OL,4,Agame battle
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlaying a game about a week during
OL,7,FWorld War Two in North Africa might not
OL,8,Fbe top of your list - but James
OL,9,FPurcell, 29, and Andy Taeger, 30,
OL,10,Fdecided to do just that.
OL,12,FThe pair met about a decade ago at a
OL,13,Fhouse party and became fast friends
OL,14,Fafter duetting to a James Blunt song.
